{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本防災廳今（2日）正式成立，由首相高市早苗領導，並由她第一把手、復興相細野豪志出任第一任防災相。</p><p>防災廳負責統籌跨部門災害對策，重點應對南海海槽大地震及首都直下型地震等「國難級」災害。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:49.553566+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:58:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:10.373036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:10.373036+00:00","content_hash":"b79ccfb7e0e910f8b67376ab0b87846598c5e7975a09b69d5cff82060b0c6f1d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}